    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778690/extras/1f5424f9c3b782433447509c2a836aa3.webp?t=1713573370\" /></div><br><br>Mahika is a top-down RPG magic adventure game with rogue like elements and a sprinkle of mystery. Discover a pixel world based on Filipino and other world cultures and mythologies.<br><br>The game was inspired by Stardew Valley, Nuclear Throne and Dungeon Souls.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778690/extras/6df900a73642f8eaffdfa97ebc4c1652.webp?t=1713573370\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Customizable character avatar<br></li><li> Plant and Farming system<br></li><li> Enemies inspired by Filipino and other world cultures<br></li><li> Fight using melee weapons or use magic to blast your enemies to pieces<br></li><li> Roguelike dungeon crawl missions</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778690/extras/1f5424f9c3b782433447509c2a836aa3.webp?t=1713573370\" /></div><br><br>Mahika is a top-down RPG magic adventure game with rogue like elements and a sprinkle of mystery. Discover a pixel world based on Filipino and other world cultures and mythologies.<br><br>The game was inspired by Stardew Valley, Nuclear Throne and Dungeon Souls.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778690/extras/6df900a73642f8eaffdfa97ebc4c1652.webp?t=1713573370\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Customizable character avatar<br></li><li> Plant and Farming system<br></li><li> Enemies inspired by Filipino and other world cultures<br></li><li> Fight using melee weapons or use magic to blast your enemies to pieces<br></li><li> Roguelike dungeon crawl missions</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An action packed pixel art styled, top down, RPG magic adventure game with rogue like elements and a sprinkle of mystery!",
